WEBVTT

00:04:28.489 --> 00:04:31.318
and I had customers in Denmark, Italy, Australia,

00:04:31.318 --> 00:04:33.925
Canada and more.

00:04:33.925 --> 00:04:36.509
Now, I had a lot to learn about my business,

00:04:36.509 --> 00:04:38.184
like branding and marketing,

00:04:38.184 --> 00:04:39.942
staying engaged with my customers,

00:04:39.942 --> 00:04:43.423
and seeing what sold the most and the least.

00:04:43.423 --> 00:04:45.837
Soon, my business really started to take off.

00:04:45.837 --> 00:04:50.084
Then one day, Forbes magazine 
contacted me when I was 10 years old.

00:04:50.084 --> 00:04:51.677
(Laughter)

00:04:51.677 --> 00:04:54.014
They wanted to feature me and my company

00:04:54.014 --> 00:04:56.036
in their article.

00:04:56.036 --> 00:04:58.117
Now a lot of people ask me,

00:04:58.117 --> 00:05:00.543
why is your business eco-friendly?